( Owns recovered key and exit. Deduction owns evidence and hypothesis.
  ZP 00 key, 01 exit, 02 pending action, fe protocol error.
  Presentation action 1..9. Deduction returns six-byte status. )
|0100
 ;receive #d0 DEO2 #0800 #d2 DEO2
 #0900 #d6 DEO2 #06 #d8 DEO BRK
@receive
 #dd DEI #02 EQU ?conclusion
 #dd DEI #00 NEQ ?done #d4 DEI #01 NEQ ?done
 #0800 LDA #01 LTH ?done #0800 LDA #09 GTH ?done
 #01 LDZ ?show
 #02 LDZ ?done
 #0800 LDA #03 NEQ ?no-key #01 #00 STZ
 @no-key #0800 LDA #02 STZ
 #0800 LDA #0900 STA #02 #dc DEO #01 #d8 DEO #01 #d9 DEO
 #d9 DEI ?done #01 #fe STZ BRK
@conclusion
 #d4 DEI #06 NEQ ?done #02 LDZ #00 EQU ?done
 #0800 LDA #0a GTH ?done #0801 LDA #3f GTH ?done
 #0802 LDA #03 GTH ?done #0803 LDA #03 GTH ?done
 #0804 LDA #03 GTH ?done #0805 LDA #01 GTH ?done
 #0805 LDA #00 EQU ?copy
 #02 LDZ #09 NEQ ?done #00 LDZ #00 EQU ?done
 #0800 LDA #0a NEQ ?done
 #01 #01 STZ
@copy
 #00 #02 STZ
 #0800 LDA2 #0900 STA2 #0802 LDA2 #0902 STA2 #0804 LDA2 #0904 STA2
 #01 LDZ #0905 STA
@show
 #01 #dc DEO #06 #d8 DEO #01 #d9 DEO #d9 DEI ?done #01 #fe STZ
@done BRK
